{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*ALL WARBAND &amp; COSMETIC DLC NOW INCLUDED IN THE MAIN GAME!*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.poster.avif?t=1776089886\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.webm?t=1776089886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warhammer Underworlds \u2013 Shadespire Edition</i> is a digital adaptation of the explosive, high-stakes, turn-based strategy tabletop game from <strong>Games Workshop</strong> that pits mighty warbands from the <strong>Age of Sigmar</strong> universe against one another in an eternal player versus player battle for Glory. Choose a warband, build your decks and carve a path to victory using <strong>dice-and-card</strong> mechanics that offer boundless strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.poster.avif?t=1776089886\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.webm?t=1776089886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE YOUR WARBAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within the towering spires of the <strong>Mirrored City of Shadespire</strong>, fourteen warbands battle it out for survival - each with unique abilities and a distinct combat style. All of these warbands are now available to play in online matches, bot matches or single-player challenges, having previously been available as DLC! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable warbands:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steelheart\u2019s Champions - Magore's Fiends - Garrek\u2019s Reavers - The Sepulchral Guard \u2013 Spiteclaw\u2019s Swarm \u2013 The Farstriders \u2013 The Chosen Axes \u2013 Ironskull\u2019s Boyz \u2013 Thorns of the Briar Queen \u2013 Eyes of the Nine \u2013 Drepur\u2019s Wraithcreepers \u2013 The Storm of Celestus \u2013 Stormsire\u2019s Cursebreakers \u2013 Mollog\u2019s Mob</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.poster.avif?t=1776089886\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.webm?t=1776089886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT YOUR DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your success is measured in Glory points - awarded for achieving objectives and vanquishing your foes. <strong>Deckbuilding</strong> is the strategic heart of <i>Warhammer Underworlds \u2013 Shadespire Edition</i>. Your <strong>20-card power deck</strong> is filled with clever gambits, powerful upgrades, and cunning spells you\u2019ll need to inflict maximum damage. Your<strong> 12-card objective deck</strong> will shape your tactical approach to a match, allowing you to score Glory by fulfilling specific conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.poster.avif?t=1776089886\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.webm?t=1776089886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLAIM THE SPOILS OF SHADESPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>rewarding progression</strong> system in both online matches and single-player Challenges allows you to earn cosmetic content including warband skins, deck portraits, and player titles! Only those who have proven themselves in the unforgiving streets of Shadespire will be able to claim these rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6fe4432c6b962802c03a174ce0fddaa4.avif?t=1776089886\" width=616 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Warhammer Classics</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warhammer Classics is a collection of the greatest titles from the annals of Warhammer video game history, spanning the last 30 years, brought back to life as a series to celebrate their iconic legacy.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Because of their classic nature, some of the content may not accurately reflect current depictions, lore, or presentation within the current Warhammer universes and settings</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"52d32ecdf8fefc4658d10350844b6661d47f7708.jpg","localized_name":"For Sigmar!","name":"For Sigmar!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1022310/52d32ecdf8fefc4658d10350844b6661d47f7708.jpg"},{"icon":"951a637076769c4d47634d9d873dbbed14b69e77.jpg","localized_name":"Skulls For The Skull Throne","name":"Skulls For The Skull Throne","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams